---
---
<section>
  <div class="slide-content" style="background:#121212; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">
    <div style="position:relative; width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">

      <!-- Círculos de luz suaves -->
      <div style="position:absolute; top:-100px; right:-100px; width:500px; height:500px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,247,205,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>
      <div style="position:absolute; bottom:-150px; left:-50px; width:400px; height:400px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,247,205,0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>

      <!-- Número de slide (superior derecho) -->
      <div style="position:absolute; top:28px; right:48px; font-size:11px; color:rgba(167,159,142,0.3); font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.15em;">03 / 15</div>

      <div style="position:relative; z-index:10; max-width:960px; width:100%; padding:0 64px;">

        <!-- Misión / Visión lado a lado -->
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:2px; margin-bottom:32px;">

          <!-- Misión -->
          <div style="padding:40px; background:rgba(255,247,205,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.25); border-right:none;">
            <div style="width:40px; height:3px; background:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:20px;"></div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:#FFF7CD; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:16px;">Misión</div>
            <p style="font-size:18px; color:#FFF7CD; line-height:1.55; margin:0; font-weight:500;">Diseñar y desarrollar soluciones de software innovadoras que resuelvan problemáticas reales, transformando necesidades concretas en herramientas de alto valor.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Visión -->
          <div style="padding:40px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.15);">
            <div style="width:40px; height:3px; background:rgba(255,247,205,0.4); margin-bottom:20px;"></div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; color:#FAF0B5; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:16px;">Visión</div>
            <p style="font-size:18px; color:#a79f8e; line-height:1.55; margin:0; font-weight:400;">Consolidarnos como empresa referente en software argentino, aliados estratégicos en la transformación digital de PyMEs y organizaciones locales.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stack tecnológico -->
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span style="font-size:11px; color:rgba(167,159,142,0.4); letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-right:4px;">Stack:</span>
          {["React", "Node.js", "Astro", "PostgreSQL", "Prisma", "TypeScript", "C/C++"].map(tech => (
            <span style="padding:5px 12px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.15); font-size:12px; color:#a79f8e; font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;">{tech}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
